#. y1:english_ids=["83_0_0","83_0_1","83_0_2","83_0_3","83_0_4","83_0_5","83_0_6","83_0_7","83_0_8","83_0_9","83_0_10","83_0_11","83_0_12","83_0_13","83_0_14","83_0_15","83_0_16","83_0_17","83_0_18","83_0_19","83_0_20","83_0_21","83_0_22","83_0_23","83_0_24","83_0_25","83_0_26","83_0_27","83_0_28","83_0_29","83_0_30","83_0_31","83_0_32","83_0_33","83_0_34","83_0_35","83_0_36","83_0_37","83_0_38","83_0_39","83_0_40","83_0_41","83_0_42","83_0_43","83_0_44","83_0_45","83_0_46","83_0_47","83_0_48","83_0_49","83_0_50","83_0_51","83_0_52","83_0_53","83_0_54","83_0_55","83_0_56","83_0_57","83_0_58","83_0_59","83_0_60","83_0_61","83_0_62","83_0_63","83_0_64","83_0_65","83_0_66","83_0_67","83_0_68","83_0_69","83_0_70","83_0_71","83_0_72","83_0_73","83_0_74","83_0_75","83_0_76","83_0_77","83_0_78","83_0_79","83_0_80","83_0_81","83_0_82","83_0_83","83_0_84","83_0_85","83_0_86","83_0_87","83_0_88","83_0_89"]
#. y1:english="\nWelcome. Would you like me to explain||how to play the games?\nWhich game would you like to||know the rules of?\nNo, {PA:10}thanks.\n...I see.{PA:20} If there's something you'd like||to know, please feel free to ask me.\nHow do I play Blackjack?\nBlackjack is a game where you try||to make your cards total 21.\nBefore starting a game,||place your bet.\nBasically it's a competition||against the dealer.\nIf your hand gets closer to 21||than the dealer, you win.{PA:10}\nThe payout will be double the amount||you bet.\nIf you get the same number as the dealer,||the game ends in a draw and\nyour bet gets returned.\nIf your total goes over 21, that's||called a Bust. If you bust, you lose.\nIf you get an Ace and a face card, that's||called a Blackjack, the name of the game.\nUnless the dealer's hand is also||a Blackjack, your payout will be\n2.5 times the amount you bet.\nHowever, if you choose to Split,||you can't get a Blackjack.\nGood luck.\nHow do I play Roulette?\nYou have to try to guess which||slot the ball will fall into.\nRoulette is so popular it's often called||the \"Queen of the Casino\".\nAccording to where you place your bets,{PA:10}||payouts can vary from 2 to 1 and 36 to 1.\nYou start betting as soon as the wheel||starts spinning, and you can bet\nuntil just a few moments before the ball is||about to be dropped.{PA:10}\nSo, {PA:10}you can wait until||the last moment before placing your bets.\nAnd please remember that you can||only bet up to 32 slots in this casino...\nGood luck.\nWhat are mystery items?\nRumour has it that you can obtain||mystery items somewhere.\nIf you use a mystery item before a game,{PA:10}\nsupposedly the goddess of fortune||will smile upon you.\nBut once you use it, it will be lost.\nAlso, there's no point in using||multiple items at one time.{PA:20}\nOnly the last one you use takes effect.\nThere are five types of them.{PA:20} The effect||of the item can be known by its name.\nIf you get one, try it out in secret.\nHow do I play Baccarat?\nThe objective of Baccarat is to guess\nwhich hand, out of the two hands||the dealer deals, is closest to \"9\".\nAll you have to do is place your bet||on the hand you think will win.\nAt the beginning of the game,\nthe dealer deals 2 cards to both||the \"PLAYER\" and the \"BANKER\".\nThe cards are turned up in order from||the \"PLAYER\" to the \"BANKER\"\nand in some cases a third card may be dealt.\nWhen the third or final cards are turned up,||the hand closest to 9 wins.\n10s and face cards equal 0,{PA:10}||and Aces equal 1.{PA:10}\nIf the sum of two or more cards||equal 10 or higher,\n10 will be subtracted from the total.\nWhen the winner and the loser is decided,||if you had bet on the winner,\nthe payout will be double the amount.\nYou can also bet on a \"Tie\".\nIf the \"PLAYER\" and the \"BANKER\" tie, the||payout will be 8 times the amount you bet.\nIn this case, the chips placed on either the||\"PLAYER\" or the \"BANKER\" will be returned.\nThe percentage of a tie is very low,||therefore the payout is quite large.\nWell, {PA:10}that's the basics.\nBaccarat is a pretty difficult game||to grasp at first, so would you like\na more detailed explanation?\nYes, please.\nLet me explain the rules pertaining to||the third card, which happens to be\nthe most complicated part of Baccarat.\nIf both the \"PLAYER\" and the \"BANKER\"||have a total other than 8 or 9\nthe game will continue\nFirst off, I'll tell you about what happens||when the total of the 2 cards of\nthe \"PLAYER\" equals 6 or 7.\nIn this case, the player cannot||draw a third card.\nAlso, the \"BANKER\" can only draw||when their total equals 5 or less.\nIf this happens, the game is over.\nNext, I'll tell you about what happens||when the total of the 2 cards of\nthe \"PLAYER\" equals 5 or less.\nIn this case, the player must draw||a third card.\nWhether the \"BANKER\" can draw a third card||or not depends on the total of the \"BANKER\"\nand the third card drawn by the \"PLAYER\".\nOkay,{PA:10} let me explain step-by-step.\nIf the total of the \"BANKER\" equals 7,||they cannot draw a third card.\nIf the total of the \"BANKER\" equals 6||and the third card drawn by the \"PLAYER\"\nis 6 or 7...\nthe \"BANKER\" draws a third card.\nIf the total of the \"BANKER\" equals 5 and||the third card drawn by the \"PLAYER\" is...\n4, 5, 6 or 7,||the \"BANKER\" draws a third card.\nIf the total of the \"BANKER\" equals 4 and||the third card drawn by the \"PLAYER\" is...\n2, 3 ,4, 5, 6 or 7,||the \"BANKER\" draws a third card.\nIf the total of the \"BANKER\" equals 3||and the third card drawn by the \"PLAYER\"\nis anything other than 8...||the \"BANKER\" draws a third card.\nIf the total of the \"BANKER\" equals 1 or 2,||the \"BANKER\" must draw a third card.\nAt this point, {PA:10}the winner and||the loser will be decided.\nHonestly,{PA:10} I don't think you can fully||understand this game\nwith just an explanation.\nTry a few games, {PA:10}and if you still don't||understand, come back and ask me again.\nGood luck."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0086.BIN:83_0_1
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0086.BIN::line:83_0_1"
msgid "Bienvenido."
msgstr ""

